      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 48,
      "text": "Slide 1: the library's dissolve is on this title"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 307,
      "text": "Select this body and give it a build in: Animate > Build In > Add an Effect > Appear (Animer > Byg ind > Tilføj en effekt > Vises). Open Build Order (Bygrækkefølge) and drag the title's Dissolve (Opløs) below the body's Appear. Comment on this slide: did it move, and what does its Start pop-up (Start) say."
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 121,
      "text": "Nonsensical task, as the dissolve landed last by itself. So I did not attempt to drag it. The start popup says ‘Ved klik’"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 47,
      "text": "Slide 2: no build here yet, the app writes both"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 274,
      "text": "Give this title a Dissolve build in and this body an Appear, both with Animate > Build In > Add an Effect (Animer > Byg ind > Tilføj en effekt). In Build Order (Bygrækkefølge), drag the title's Dissolve below the body's Appear. Comment on this slide: did it move. Then save."
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 24,
      "text": "It moved… here it worked"
    },
